  "description": "and Market Update...What Is Next?",
  "body_html": "<p>Happy Tuesday! We are starting to see life again in the markets. Is it a breakout? A fake out? <strong>Watch the 2 minute video, its why I make them!</strong></p><p>Also in this video, I discuss why I think Viasat, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$VSAT&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>  is a buy. It had a breakout today. This is likely a stock benefiting from Starlink’s suffering relationships with Iran and their allies. If you have different thoughts, feel free to share them in the comments for everyone to benefit from. </p><p>Mostly just checking in with everyone. As I have said several times…don’t stare at charts all day long…but don’t run away either. I’ll let you know when I think it is time to go heavy again. Enjoy the downtime! Just patiently wait for a favorable market and double down when it is working for us. </p><p>Lastly a reminder: I will be going on vacation to Costa Rica March 27th to April 8th. I will check in on occasion but expect limited responses from me. This is great news for you! The market ALWAYS goes up when I go on vacation. 100% of the time. Not joking…many of our members literally trade this as a news event lol. 😂😑</p><p>Thanks for stopping by! 👍</p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary-fc6?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Summary</a> |</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-stocktok-playbook-everything?r=4z8lgl\">The StockTok Playbook</a></strong></em> <em><strong>|</strong></em> <em><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a> </strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><p>Other Resources: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a><em><strong> | </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing For Beginners Series</a> <em><strong>|</strong> </em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/90-of-traders-fail-and-100-of-them?r=4z8lgl\">Tools Tim Built for TradingView</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-frequently-asked-questions?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Screener FAQ</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/losers-dollar-cost-average-down?r=4z8lgl\">How to DCA UP!</a> </p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div>",
